  m_text: "<b>V\xE0o n\u0103m 1972, Singer v\xE0 Nicolson \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EC1
    xu\u1EA5t ra m\xF4 h\xECnh c\u1EA5u t\u1EA1o c\u1EE7a m\xE0ng sinh ch\u1EA5t
    hay c\xF2n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1ECDi l\xE0 m\xF4 h\xECnh kh\u1EA3m \u0111\u1ED9ng.
    Theo m\xF4 h\xECnh \u0111\xF3, m\xE0ng sinh ch\u1EA5t c\xF3 c\u1EA5u t\u1EA1o
    bao g\u1ED3m 2 th\xE0nh ph\u1EA7n ch\xEDnh l\xE0 phospholipid v\xE0 protein.</b>"
